OL,3,GNEWSAMan who died in double fatal crash
OL,4,Aduring Storm Boelo was a loving
OL,5,Agrandfather
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn 84-year-old man who died in a crash
OL,8,Fthat also killed a 20-year-old man has
OL,9,Fbeen described as a "gentle and loving"
OL,10,Fgrandfather.
OL,12,FJim McCollum was pronounced dead at the
OL,13,Fscene of the crash which happened on
OL,14,Fthe B708 Lower Bathville road in
OL,15,FBathgate at about 12:15 on Sunday,
OL,16,Fduring Storm Boelo.
OL,18,FIt involved McCollum's blue Peugeot
OL,19,F208, a white BMW 116D and a blue
OL,20,FCitroen Saxo.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
