OL,3,GNEWSAMan who died in double fatal crash
OL,4,Aduring Storm Boelo was a loving
OL,5,Agrandfather
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe BMW driver was also pronounced dead
OL,8,Fat the scene - but has not yet been
OL,9,Fnamed by police - while his 19-year-old
OL,10,Fpassenger was taken to hospital for
OL,11,Ftreatment.
